@startuml U16_token_lifecycle_state
!include style.iuml
title U16 — Token lifecycle (state machine, final; from 06)

[*] --> Moving : Start, parallel split\nor join fires
Moving --> Moving : decision (one branch)\nor merge
Moving --> Waiting : reaches a task or timer\n/ wait id t@node#n, TaskRequested\n(+ deadline / answer-timeout timers)
Waiting --> Moving : TaskCompleted naming this wait\n[outputs valid] / store outputs
Waiting --> Waiting : temporary failure or no answer in time\n[retries left] / retry after backoff (same wait id)
Waiting --> Waiting : deadline passed / escalate (role changes)
Waiting --> Moving : failed for good, or retries used up\n[fallback drawn] / take fallback arrow
Waiting --> Waiting : late or duplicate reply\n(another wait id) / ignored
Moving --> Parked : reaches a parallel join\n[not all inputs present]
Parked --> [*] : join fires (consumed)
Moving --> [*] : parallel split (replaced by children)\nor End (consumed)
Moving --> Cancelled : case fails or compensates
Waiting --> Cancelled : case fails or compensates\n/ CancelRequested
Parked --> Cancelled : case fails or compensates
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
